            "introtext": "\t<h5>for information on rental assistance or other economic assistance, Please visit our St. Vincent de Paul Ministry Page <span class=\"button\"><a href=\"https://www.stmary-woodstock.org/ministries/organizations/st-vincent-de-paul-society\">HERE</a></span></h5>",
